===============================================================================
NIST NFIQ 2 (io.mosip:nfiq2.0)
===============================================================================

io.mosip:nfiq2.0 is a Java port of NIST Fingerprint Image Quality 2 v2.3.0
(https://github.com/usnistgov/NFIQ2) and embeds its random forest model
nist_plain_tir-ink.yaml (MD5 b4a1e7586b3be906f9770e4b77768038). NIST software
is not subject to copyright protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. 105)
and is provided "AS IS" by NIST, without warranty of any kind. NIST does not
endorse this port.


